{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You live hard and drive fast.  When you need to get somewhere, collateral damage is not your concern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of your beloved Big Blue, and go further than ever before.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lane-locked controls means precision dodging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A powerful pneumatic suspension enables big-air jumps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heavy armor makes you invulnerable to most collisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No brakes suggests you are not afraid of commitment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Great power brings significant fuel consumption.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This will be a fun, fast ride through six distinctly-styled biomes, but honestly you might be too busy to notice.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Licensed Driver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3494680/cc2c9088ce559f0783064f46a47094228ff3a967.jpg"},{"name":"Advanced Basics","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3494680/14ad64f8ba1639224fb6226a3ed29f44352de0a6.jpg"},{"name":"Demolition Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3494680/1d236452fa9ec2e1fb5ad8bd514ed5c849e86fce.jpg"},{"name":"Pinball Wizard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3494680/1ae150ef2fdf402d172bfa0b148153270a38a9b3.jpg"},{"name":"The Centurion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3494680/eae1177b82f67f830ef20666f93b9eb02f03161b.jpg"},{"name":"The Proclaimer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3494680/073cf0c7ea3039748c7a74abc8df1172c3402fca.jpg"},{"name":"The Cleveland","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3494680/278edacf755b90d3a97180361a1b805edfa2c0a7.jpg"